    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7809d910464696ff23b4fc2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次似乎可以毫无意外地进行比赛。\n今天一整天，\n里见光钻也没提到过半次关于魔咒的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e49ca4fc2fe6e6c85a78b7993723d3d64069dbed9ea95df2e77652140f072",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
